		(uuid "34108832-0e84-4e52-91d8-898fc830d7ee")
	)
	(text "Gain: R804/R809=0 and R805/R810=100k (divider). Rf R801/R806=0, Rg R803/R808 DNP -> x1. Attenuate: change R804 vs R805 (e.g. 100k/100k = x0.5). Gain>1: populate Rg and raise Rf. + pulldown is R805, not Rg. AMP801 is drawn mirrored: - input on top, + input below."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 21.844 22.606 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6c3c8d6a-290d-48b1-9517-61a9dee9eb39")
	)
